# backend/tests/test_generation_contract.py compares this fixture to the
# publisher's output byte for byte, so it has to check out identically on every
# platform. This repo is developed with core.autocrlf=true, which would rewrite
# it to CRLF on Windows while CI checks out LF -- the comparison would then fail
# on whichever platform did not generate it.
worker/tests/fixtures/*.json text eol=lf
